{"id":"distill-stone","name":{"en":"Distill Stone","ja":"蒸留石"},"desc":{"en":"A stone with countless little holes. It can be used as a filtration system. Because of its porous property, it's very light in weight.","ja":"肉眼では見えないくらい、無数の細かい穴が 開いた石。液体のろ過などに使われるのでこ の名がついた。前述の通り中は隙間だらけな ので、見た目より遥かに軽い。"},"level":2,"locations":[{"id":"arland-area","name":{"en":"Arland Area","ja":"アーランド周辺地域"}},{"id":"continental-coastline","name":{"en":"Continental Coastline","ja":"大陸海岸線"}},{"id":"primordial-island","name":{"en":"Primordial Island","ja":"原初の島"}}],"traits":{"id":"lightweight","name":{"en":"Lightweight","ja":"軽量化された"}},"categories":[{"id":"ore","name":{"en":"(Ore)","ja":"（鉱石類）"},"icon":"totori-category-ore"},{"id":"supplement","name":{"en":"(Supplement)","ja":"（中和剤）"},"icon":"totori-category-supplement"}],"item_type":"Ingredient","index":19}